{"id":"H5234","lemma":"נָכַר","transliteration":"nakhar","sayIt":"na-KHAR","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to recognize","meaning":"1) to recognise, acknowledge, know, respect, discern, regard\n1a) (Niphal) to be recognised\n1b) (Piel) to regard\n1c) (Hiphil)\n1c1) to regard, observe, pay attention to, pay regard to, notice\n1c2) to recognise (as formerly known), perceive\n1c3) to be willing to recognise or acknowledge, acknowledge with honour\n1c4) to be acquainted with\n1c5) to distinguish, understand\n1d) (Hithpael) to make oneself known","glosses":["recognized","show partiality","disguised","recognize him","see","examine it"],"count":47,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-27","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"recognize him","kjv":"And he discerned"}},{"chapterId":"gen-31","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"see","kjv":"discern"}},{"chapterId":"gen-37","v":32,"renderings":{"bsb":"Examine it","kjv":"know"}},{"chapterId":"gen-37","v":33,"renderings":{"bsb":"His father recognized it","kjv":"And he knew it"}},{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"Whose seal","kjv":"Discern"}},{"chapterId":"gen-38","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"recognized the items","kjv":"acknowledged"}},{"chapterId":"gen-42","v":7,"renderings":{"bsb":"he recognized them","kjv":"and he knew"}},{"chapterId":"gen-42","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"recognized","kjv":"knew"}},{"chapterId":"deu-1","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"Show no partiality","kjv":"Ye shall not respect"}},{"chapterId":"deu-16","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"or show partiality","kjv":"thou shalt not respect"}},{"chapterId":"deu-21","v":17,"renderings":{"bsb":"he must acknowledge","kjv":"But he shall acknowledge"}},{"chapterId":"deu-32","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"misunderstand","kjv":"should behave themselves strangely"}},{"chapterId":"deu-33","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"He disregarded","kjv":"neither did he acknowledge"}},{"chapterId":"jdg-18","v":3,"renderings":{"bsb":"recognized","kjv":"they knew"}},{"chapterId":"rut-2","v":10,"r